# This package reads no runtime environment: Angular compiles src/environments/ into the bundle,
# @server-start
# and the API is always reached at relative /api, so there is no API URL variable and no secret
# to set. Anything placed in a browser bundle is readable by anyone; never put a secret in it.
# @server-end
# @noserver-start
# so there is no variable and no secret to set. Anything placed in a browser bundle is readable by
# anyone; never put a secret in it.
# @noserver-end
